@startuml
[*] --> PowerOn : power-on

state "Power On" as PowerOn
state "Problem During Startup" as ProblemStartup
state "Ready To Use" as ReadyToUse
state "Monitoring" as Monitoring
state "Alarm And Alerts" as AlarmAndAlerts
state "Normal" as Normal

PowerOn --> ProblemStartup : problem during startup
ProblemStartup --> [*] : stop system

PowerOn --> ReadyToUse : everything fine during startup

ReadyToUse --> Reset : reset pressed
Reset --> PowerOn : reset to power on

ReadyToUse --> Activate : activate pressed
Activate --> Monitoring : start monitoring

Monitoring --> AlarmAndAlerts : sensor triggered
AlarmAndAlerts --> Monitoring : false alarm or time ends

ReadyToUse --> TurnOff : turn off pressed
TurnOff --> Normal : stop system and return to normal

Normal --> PowerOn : power on pressed

@enduml
